015/07/28/7552085/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浴衣の着付けをしてくれたマイマイとっ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆったんもしてくれる！って言ってたんだけどもしかしたら部数違うから出来ないかも！ってなってマイマイがしてくれた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/28/7552085/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二人ともありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/28/7552085/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の個別握手会でも沢山の方とお話できて幸せでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/28/7552085/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ノギビンゴ見たよ～とかラジオ聞いたよ～とか\n乃木えいごみたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今更だけど乃木どこの方言告白大好き！\nとかとか乃木ルームのキス顔やって～とか\nでも聞いて！振りとかでもなんでもないからキス顔リクエスは辞めて！もうしないよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/28/7552085/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぁでもそんなこんなで素敵な時間過ごせました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/28/7552085/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浴衣はどうだったかな⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また遊びにきてね～(^O^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/28/7552085/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国握手会ではキャプテンれいかちゃんとペアでした"},{"type":"image","src":"cid:2C60A4869DF3969884E7D83E16C722DE-12@decoMailer","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"背大きいね！って何回か言われたから\n｢れいかちゃんの隣にいるから大きく見えるのかも♡｣って言ったった"},{"type":"image","src":"ht